                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 704.9312.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-03-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 20,
                    1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Chinese charge d’affaires at Mexico City has requested that the American
                    consul at Guaymas be instructed to extend protection to Chinese subjects at that
                    place. Requests instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
